 {"id":"Speedy-003","title":"[Epic: Micro Sentence Bar] Add integration tests and manual testing","description":"Create comprehensive integration tests and perform manual testing verification.\n\nIntegration tests:\n- End-to-end sentence progress calculation\n- Integration between progress calc and bar rendering\n- Multiple sentences and word positions\n\nManual testing checklist:\n- Bar position (10px offset)\n- Bar width (50% container)\n- Bar height (2px)\n- Fill progression\n- Sentence boundary reset\n- Stability (no jitter)\n- Various WPM settings\n- Single-word sentences\n- Long sentences\n- Navigation (j/k keys)\n\nFiles:\n- Create: tests/progress_bar_integration.rs\n- Create: tests/manual_test_results.md\n\nImplementation Plan: docs/plans/2026-02-05-micro-sentence-bar-implementation.md Tasks 7-8","acceptance_criteria":"All integration tests passing, manual testing completed with checklist","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"henry.thdu@protonmail.com","estimated_minutes":60,"created_at":"2026-02-05T15:33:38.0359898-03:00","created_by":"Henry Du","updated_at":"2026-02-06T11:31:49.70813465-03:00","closed_at":"2026-02-06T11:31:49.70813465-03:00","close_reason":"Closed","labels":["micro-sentence-bar"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"Speedy-003","depends_on_id":"Speedy-5l7","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-02-05T15:37:23.536796701-03:00","created_by":"Henry Du"}]}
