 {"id":"Speedy-885","title":"[Tech Debt] Extend punctuation detection","description":"Add support for semicolons (;), ellipsis (...), em dashes (—). Update extract_punctuation() to detect these marks. Add is_sentence_terminator() and PAUSE_MARKERS constants. Update is_comma() function. Add unit tests for new punctuation types. Update find_sentence_start() to handle additional terminators. Reference: Section 7 Punctuation Limitations extension path in design document.","status":"closed","priority":3,"issue_type":"task","owner":"henry.thdu@protonmail.com","created_at":"2026-01-23T16:16:08.805968453-03:00","created_by":"Henry Du","updated_at":"2026-02-06T11:39:03.124067247-03:00","closed_at":"2026-02-06T11:39:03.124067247-03:00","close_reason":"Closed"}
